# Dataset
# (Keep folder, ignore heavy files)
# =========================
dataset/*.pkl
dataset/*.zip
dataset/*.tar
dataset/*.tar.gz
dataset/*.7z

# Keep documentation/examples
!dataset/README.md

# =========================
